      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "A post office has served Silver Creek since 1880, marking its long‑standing presence in Floyd County.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        13
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Silver_Creek%2C_Georgia",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Silver Creek Trail, a 10‑foot‑wide asphalt path on an abandoned railroad bed, crosses the Etowah River and links to Rome Heritage Trail.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
